{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Indebt_v2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s gone under, but your debt hasn\u2019t. You\u2019ve got three days to hit your next payment to the loan shark,or end up as chum. You and your crew are heading out to fish what\u2019s left of the sea\u2026 and what probably should\u2019ve been left alone. Fail, and it won\u2019t just be the boat you lose it\u2019ll be what\u2019s left of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/InDebt2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Fishordie_v2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use different rods, harpoons and more, each creature requires a different approach. Fix what breaks, and survive the deep. Return back to port and sell your catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Fishordiev2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Survive_v2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teamwork is essential, and so is the right gear. Six players. One boat. Constant breakdowns, lurking monsters, no backup and Steven. Every run is chaos in the best way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Pan2-test.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>These waters aren\u2019t safe. Strange things swim in the dark, and some don\u2019t like to be disturbed. Get back before nightfall, or you might meet the Codfather... and his missus.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Just make sure you bring back a good haul. Mr.\u00a0 Sloane S.Hark always collects what he's owed.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576880?t=1747290717","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576880?t=1747290717","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/1768e823a22f46a61c783785a664ebe84bcfa7b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747290717","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/1768e823a22f46a61c783785a664ebe84bcfa7b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747290717","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Join-our-discord.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Indebt_v2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s gone under, but your debt hasn\u2019t. You\u2019ve got three days to hit your next payment to the loan shark,or end up as chum. You and your crew are heading out to fish what\u2019s left of the sea\u2026 and what probably should\u2019ve been left alone. Fail, and it won\u2019t just be the boat you lose it\u2019ll be what\u2019s left of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/InDebt2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Fishordie_v2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use different rods, harpoons and more, each creature requires a different approach. Fix what breaks, and survive the deep. Return back to port and sell your catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Fishordiev2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Survive_v2.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teamwork is essential, and so is the right gear. Six players. One boat. Constant breakdowns, lurking monsters, no backup and Steven. Every run is chaos in the best way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/Pan2-test.gif?t=1747290717\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>These waters aren\u2019t safe. Strange things swim in the dark, and some don\u2019t like to be disturbed. Get back before nightfall, or you might meet the Codfather... and his missus.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Just make sure you bring back a good haul. Mr.\u00a0 Sloane S.Hark always collects what he's owed.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["ManaBrigade"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app